WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.056 --> 00:00:04.660
STRUGGLING.

00:00:00.456 --> 00:00:07.363
THIS IS A VERY TIGHT-KNIT

00:00:04.794 --> 00:00:10.199
COMMUNITY IN PARKLAND.

00:00:07.497 --> 00:00:16.673
THANK YOU BOTH.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:17.607
CRIMINAL DEFENSE ATTORNEY TED

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.143
WILLIAMS.

00:00:18.108 --> 00:00:21.244
WE SAW THE POLICE, THE SHERIFF,

00:00:20.276 --> 00:00:22.846
THE FBI.

00:00:21.377 --> 00:00:24.748
WE SEE FIRST RESPONDERS.

00:00:22.979 --> 00:00:27.050
YOU SEE EVERYBODY, THE

00:00:24.881 --> 00:00:29.386
SUPERINTENDENT, THE GOVERNOR,

00:00:27.183 --> 00:00:30.987
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL, EVERYBODY

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:33.623
ALL HANDS ON DECK TODAY.

00:00:31.121 --> 00:00:37.027
I WAS WATCHING THIS ALL UNFOLD

00:00:33.757 --> 00:00:38.228
LIVE WHEN I WAS ON MY RADIO SHOW

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.829
TODAY AND JUST HOW AMAZING THESE

00:00:38.361 --> 00:00:40.263
PEOPLE ARE.

00:00:38.962 --> 00:00:42.866
BUT IT’S AFTER THE FACT.

00:00:40.397 --> 00:00:43.567
DO WE NEED TO RECONSIDER SAFETY

00:00:42.999 --> 00:00:46.169
FOR THESE SCHOOLS?

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:48.572
&gt;&gt;  WELL, YEAH, I THINK WE DO.

00:00:46.303 --> 00:00:50.207
BUT LET ME SAY, SEAN, FROM THE

00:00:48.705 --> 00:00:51.441
BEGINNING, THE INTERVIEW YOU

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.842
JUST HAD WITH THOSE TWO YOUNG

00:00:51.575 --> 00:00:54.144
WOMEN.

00:00:51.975 --> 00:00:54.811
WE SAW THE BEST OF AMERICA IN

00:00:54.278 --> 00:00:58.448
THOSE TWO YOUNG WOMEN.

00:00:54.945 --> 00:01:00.384
AND WHEN YOU LOOK AT THIS GUY

00:00:58.582 --> 00:01:04.054
NICOLAS CRUZ, YOU’RE SEEING, AS

00:01:00.517 --> 00:01:10.294
THE GOVERNOR SAID, PURE EVIL.

00:01:04.188 --> 00:01:12.129
THIS WAS A COLD-BLOODED,

00:01:10.427 --> 00:01:12.596
CALCULATED, CARRIED-OUT CARNAGE

00:01:12.263 --> 00:01:15.900
MASSACRE.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:17.802
AND WE DO HAVE TO START

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:20.271
RETHINKING HOW WE HAVE GUARDS

00:01:17.935 --> 00:01:20.771
AND SECURITY IN THESE VARIOUS

00:01:20.404 --> 00:01:25.676
SCHOOLS.

00:01:20.905 --> 00:01:27.044
THE SAD COMMENTARY, SAWN  --

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.212
SEAN, IS WE CANNOT MAKE OUR

00:01:27.178 --> 00:01:29.714
SCHOOLS A PRISON.

00:01:28.346 --> 00:01:31.849
WE DID HAVE A GUARD THERE.

00:01:29.847 --> 00:01:33.851
BUT IF SOMEBODY IS HELLBENT ON

00:01:31.983 --> 00:01:36.187
GOING IN A SCHOOL AND KILLING

00:01:33.985 --> 00:01:38.256
YOUNG PEOPLE, 12 OF THESE

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.589
BEAUTIFUL YOUNG PEOPLE ARE DEAD

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:41.125
TONIGHT.

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:42.160
THIS IS A TRAGEDY, SEAN, IN AND

00:01:41.259 --> 00:01:44.429
OF ITSELF.

00:01:42.293 --> 00:01:44.796
&gt;&gt;  THIS IS NOT A POLITICAL

00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:46.764
STATEMENT.

00:01:44.929 --> 00:01:48.299
I KNOW I’M KNOWN FOR TALKING

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:51.102
POLITICS ALL THE TIME.

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:53.571
THIS IS NOT POLITICAL.

00:01:51.235 --> 00:01:55.240
I DON’T THINK IT IS SOMETHING

00:01:53.705 --> 00:01:56.808
THAT MOST PEOPLE WOULD DISAGREE

00:01:55.373 --> 00:01:58.510
WITH.

00:01:56.941 --> 00:01:59.410
AND MANNY, I’LL THROW THIS TO

00:01:58.643 --> 00:02:01.646
YOU.

00:01:59.544 --> 00:02:03.381
IF YOU’RE IN ANY ADMINISTRATION

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:03.715
BUILDING -- IN THIS CASE IT’S A

00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:05.283
SCHOOL.

00:02:03.848 --> 00:02:07.285
IT SEEMS THERE’S GOT TO BE

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:11.756
GREATER ORDER IN TERMS OF

00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:14.492
MONITORING WHO’S GETTING INTO

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:15.227
THESE SCHOOLS.

00:02:14.626 --> 00:02:15.894
I KNOW SCHOOLS THAT MONITOR AND

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.661
CONTROL WHO GETS INTO THEM.

00:02:16.027 --> 00:02:19.164
IT CAN BE DONE AND IT CAN BE

00:02:16.795 --> 00:02:21.166
DONE FAIRLY EASILY.

00:02:19.297 --> 00:02:22.334
BUT MORE IMPORTANTLY -- AND THEY

00:02:21.299 --> 00:02:26.571
DID HAVE A GUARD.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:27.673
BUT A SCHOOL THIS BIG WITH 3200

00:02:26.705 --> 00:02:30.609
STUDENTS AND MULTIPLE BUILDINGS,

00:02:27.806 --> 00:02:31.944
IT SEEMS TO ME YOU NEED A FEW

00:02:30.742 --> 00:02:34.246
PEOPLE IN EACH BUILDING.

00:02:32.077 --> 00:02:34.580
RETIRED MILITARY, RETIRED

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:36.715
POLICE.

00:02:34.713 --> 00:02:38.350
AND I WOULD THINK OVER TIME THAT

00:02:36.849 --> 00:02:40.252
FAMILIES -- WE’RE NOT TALKING

00:02:38.484 --> 00:02:42.287
ABOUT ALL THAT MUCH MONEY AT THE

00:02:40.385 --> 00:02:43.822
END OF THE DAY IF EACH DISTRICT

00:02:42.421 --> 00:02:46.992
IS PAYING FOR THAT SECURITY.

00:02:43.956 --> 00:02:48.527
EVERY BUILDINGS I WALK INTO IN

00:02:47.126 --> 00:02:50.362
NEW YORK CITY, EVERY SINGLE

00:02:48.661 --> 00:02:52.631
BUILDING, IF I DON’T HAVE AN ID,

00:02:50.496 --> 00:02:53.899
I WILL GO THROUGH SECURITY.

00:02:52.765 --> 00:02:54.767
AND IF I DON’T HAVE A CLEARANCE,

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:57.770
I’M NOT GETTING IN.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:03:04.310
AND IF WE CAN DO IT IN EVERY

00:02:57.903 --> 00:03:06.312
BUILDING IN NEW YORK POST-9/11,

00:03:04.443 --> 00:03:08.047
I WOULD THINK WE CAN DO IT IN

00:03:06.445 --> 00:03:09.215
EVERY SCHOOL IN AMERICA IF WE

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:10.983
WANT TO.

00:03:09.348 --> 00:03:11.284
&gt;&gt;  THIS HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH

00:03:11.117 --> 00:03:12.451
GUNS.

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:12.919
THIS HAS TO DO WITH PROTECTING

00:03:12.585 --> 00:03:15.288
OUR CHILDREN.

00:03:13.052 --> 00:03:17.256
I TOTALLY AGREE WITH YOU IN

00:03:15.421 --> 00:03:19.125
TERMS OF HAVING FORMER MILITARY

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:22.095
AND/OR FORMER LAW ENFORCEMENT.

00:03:19.259 --> 00:03:27.967
ONE WAY TO DO IT IS TO PERHAPS

00:03:22.228 --> 00:03:30.236
FEDERALIZE IT.

00:03:28.101 --> 00:03:32.705
SO THAT MIGHT BE SOMETHING THAT

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:35.074
CONGRESS MAY WANT TO CONSIDER

00:03:32.839 --> 00:03:37.677
AND MOVING FORWARD SET UP A

00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:38.812
FEDERAL SYSTEM TO PROTECT OUR

00:03:37.811 --> 00:03:40.413
SCHOOLS, BECAUSE SOME SCHOOL

00:03:38.945 --> 00:03:42.315
DISTRICTS HONESTLY DON’T HAVE

00:03:40.547 --> 00:03:44.417
THE BUDGET FOR IT OR MAY NOT BE

00:03:42.449 --> 00:03:45.819
WILLING TO RAISE TAXES FOR IT,

00:03:44.551 --> 00:03:46.119
EVEN THOUGH IT’S A NECESSARY

00:03:45.952 --> 00:03:48.555
THING.

00:03:46.252 --> 00:03:51.424
&gt;&gt;  AT THE END OF THE DAY, WE’VE

00:03:48.688 --> 00:03:55.028
GOT TO PUT A PRICE -- I REMEMBER

00:03:51.558 --> 00:03:55.395
THE MOVIE YEARS AGO "LEAN ON

00:03:55.161 --> 00:03:58.398
ME."

00:03:55.529 --> 00:03:58.698
IT WAS ABOUT THE PRINCIPAL JOE

00:03:58.532 --> 00:04:00.934
CLARK.

00:03:58.832 --> 00:04:02.002
HE GOT IN TROUBLE BECAUSE HE

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:03.804
CHAINED THE SCHOOL DOOR SHUT.

00:04:02.135 --> 00:04:04.204
THAT’S NOT NECESSARILY THE

00:04:03.937 --> 00:04:05.939
ANSWER.

00:04:04.337 --> 00:04:07.974
THERE SHOULD BE VERY SPECIFIC

00:04:06.073 --> 00:04:09.309
ENTRY POINTS AND OTHER ENTRY

00:04:08.108 --> 00:04:12.279
POINTS SHOULD BE CLOSED OFF.

00:04:09.443 --> 00:04:13.380
BUT BEYOND THAT -- AND LOOK, I

00:04:12.412 --> 00:04:14.414
DON’T KNOW IF IT WOULD BE

00:04:13.513 --> 00:04:15.949
APPLICABLE IN THIS SITUATION.

00:04:14.548 --> 00:04:17.484
BUT I’VE GOT TO BELIEVE IN SOME

00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:19.319
SITUATIONS THAT IF YOU HAVE

00:04:17.618 --> 00:04:21.088
FIRST-LINE DEFENDERS THERE,

00:04:19.453 --> 00:04:22.556
PEOPLE THAT ARE TRAINED, RETIRED

00:04:21.221 --> 00:04:24.758
MILITARY, RETIRED POLICE, THAT

00:04:22.689 --> 00:04:25.759
THEY’RE GOING TO BE ABLE TO AT

00:04:24.892 --> 00:04:26.093
LEAST HOLD OFF FOR THE FIVE

00:04:25.893 --> 00:04:27.094
MINUTES.

00:04:26.226 --> 00:04:28.429
THE POLICE GOT THERE.

00:04:27.227 --> 00:04:31.098
THE SHERIFF GOT THERE.

00:04:28.562 --> 00:04:32.099
THEY GOT THERE AS FAST AS

00:04:31.231 --> 00:04:34.201
HUMANLY POSSIBLE.

00:04:32.232 --> 00:04:36.170
SWAT TEAM WAS THERE.

00:04:34.335 --> 00:04:37.471
FIRST RESPONDERS WERE THERE.

00:04:36.303 --> 00:04:39.473
EVERYONE DID THEIR JOB TODAY AND

00:04:37.605 --> 00:04:40.775
DID IT SO WELL.

00:04:39.607 --> 00:04:42.576
BUT I’M JUST THINKING FOR THE

00:04:40.908 --> 00:04:43.644
LONG TERM, WE’VE GOT TO SECURE

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.313
THESE SCHOOLS.

00:04:43.778 --> 00:04:46.947
AGAIN, IT’S NOT ABOUT GUNS.

00:04:45.446 --> 00:04:48.015
IT’S SECURE THE SCHOOLS.

00:04:47.081 --> 00:04:52.286
&gt;&gt;  100%.

00:04:48.149 --> 00:04:54.322
&gt;&gt;  I’VE GOT TO TELL BOTH YOU

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:56.157
GUYS, I DISAGREE.

00:04:54.455 --> 00:04:58.559
IT IS ALSO ABOUT GUNS.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:05:03.398
IF YOU PUT A SECURITY GUARD IN

00:04:58.693 --> 00:05:05.199
WITH A POP GUN IN ONE OF THESE

00:05:03.531 --> 00:05:09.570
SCHOOLS AND YOU’VE GOT A GUY

00:05:05.333 --> 00:05:10.938
COME IN WITH AN AR-15 RIFLE --

00:05:09.704 --> 00:05:14.108
&gt;&gt;I’M TALKING ABOUT ARMED

00:05:11.072 --> 00:05:14.809
FORMER MILITARY AND ARMED FORMER

00:05:14.242 --> 00:05:16.878
POLICE.

00:05:14.943 --> 00:05:18.813
THESE ARE PEOPLE WE TRUST.

00:05:17.011 --> 00:05:19.981
THOSE RETIRED MILITARY AND

00:05:18.947 --> 00:05:21.182
POLICE WOULD BECOME THE BEST

00:05:20.115 --> 00:05:21.483
FRIENDS OF THE STUDENTS OVER

00:05:21.316 --> 00:05:22.884
TIME.

00:05:21.616 --> 00:05:24.519
THEY GET TO KNOW EACH OTHER.

00:05:23.017 --> 00:05:26.054
IT WOULD BE GOOD ALL THE WAY

00:05:24.652 --> 00:05:27.522
AROUND FOR EVERYBODY.

00:05:26.187 --> 00:05:29.991
WE CAN SECURE ANYTHING WE WANT

00:05:27.655 --> 00:05:31.259
TO SECURE IN THIS COUNTRY AND

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:31.626
NOBODY’S GOING TO CONVINCE ME

00:05:31.393 --> 00:05:32.894
OTHERWISE.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.196
&gt;&gt;  I TOTALLY AGREE.

00:05:33.028 --> 00:05:36.431
SO GOING BACK TO FORMER

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:40.001
MILITARY, FORMER LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:05:36.565 --> 00:05:42.871
AS AN ADDED BENEFIT, GOING BACK

00:05:40.135 --> 00:05:44.940
TO YOUR WIN-WIN, NOW YOU HAVE

00:05:43.004 --> 00:05:47.743
SOMEBODY WHO’S BEEN TRAINED.

00:05:45.073 --> 00:05:49.778
AND IF THERE’S OTHER THINGS

00:05:47.876 --> 00:05:50.679
GOING ON IN THE SCHOOL, THIS IS

00:05:49.911 --> 00:05:52.481
A TRAINED PROFESSIONAL THAT CAN

00:05:50.812 --> 00:05:54.616
DEAL WITH THAT, IDENTIFY IT,

00:05:52.614 --> 00:05:56.718
INVESTIGATE IT AND DEAL WITH IT.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.954
SO THAT’S AN ADDED BENEFIT OF

00:05:56.852 --> 00:05:59.254
HAVING SOMEBODY OF THAT CALIBER

00:05:59.087 --> 00:06:00.722
THERE.

00:05:59.388 --> 00:06:03.559
BUT IT HAS TO BE FUNDED.

00:06:00.856 --> 00:06:04.960
AND IT HAS TO BE A SERIOUS

00:06:03.692 --> 00:06:07.863
CONVERSATION WHERE WE AS A

00:06:05.094 --> 00:06:10.232
NATION SAY ENOUGH AND WE NEED TO

00:06:07.996 --> 00:06:14.236
FUND THIS JUST PERHAPS, LIKE I

00:06:10.366 --> 00:06:15.304
MENTIONED, THE TSA PROGRAM.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:18.073
&gt;&gt;  I WAS NOT TALKING ABOUT

00:06:15.437 --> 00:06:18.407
UNARMED FORMER RETIRED MILITARY

00:06:18.207 --> 00:06:19.575
POLICE.

00:06:18.541 --> 00:06:21.811
THEY DON’T HAVE TO BE SHOWING --

00:06:19.708 --> 00:06:22.211
THEY COULD OBVIOUSLY HAVE IT

00:06:21.944 --> 00:06:23.579
CONCEALED.

00:06:22.344 --> 00:06:24.747
BUT THEY CERTAINLY WOULD BE THE

00:06:23.712 --> 00:06:27.616
FRONT LINE OF DEFENSE.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.551
BUT I DO BELIEVE SECURING THOSE

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.152
DOORS.

00:06:28.684 --> 00:06:31.320
NOBODY THAT IS EXPELLED FROM THE

00:06:30.286 --> 00:06:32.388
SCHOOL SHOULD HAVE ACCESS TO

00:06:31.454 --> 00:06:34.524
THAT SCHOOL EVER.

00:06:32.522 --> 00:06:35.525
THE OTHER THING IS PAYING

00:06:34.657 --> 00:06:38.261
ATTENTION TO MENTAL HEALTH

00:06:35.658 --> 00:06:40.863
ISSUES OR DISGRUNTLED KIDS OR

00:06:38.394 --> 00:06:42.698
DISCIPLINARY ISSUES, LOOKING AT

00:06:40.997 --> 00:06:45.501
THE SOCIAL MEDIA FOOTPRINT OF A

00:06:42.832 --> 00:06:46.703
KID YOU THROW OUT OF SCHOOL.

00:06:45.635 --> 00:06:47.804
APPARENTLY, WE’RE LEARNING WE

00:06:46.836 --> 00:06:48.571
COULD HAVE LEARNED A LOT ABOUT

00:06:47.937 --> 00:06:50.540
THIS KID.

00:06:48.705 --> 00:06:51.374
AND THAT HAPPENS AFTER ALMOST

00:06:50.673 --> 00:06:53.243
EVERY SHOOTING.

00:06:51.508 --> 00:06:53.843
PEOPLE ARE TELEGRAPHING WHERE

00:06:53.376 --> 00:06:54.777
THEY’RE HEADED.

00:06:53.977 --> 00:06:56.412
&gt;&gt;  YOU’RE RIGHT.

00:06:54.911 --> 00:06:57.647
IF YOU SEE SOMETHING, YOU NEED

00:06:56.546 --> 00:06:59.716
TO SAY SOMETHING.

00:06:57.781 --> 00:07:00.183
AND WE DON’T HAVE ENOUGH OF

00:06:59.849 --> 00:07:02.285
THAT.

00:07:00.316 --> 00:07:05.822
BUT I WAS ALSO HAPPY, I MUST SAY

00:07:02.419 --> 00:07:08.391
-- AND I’M USING THE WORD HAPPY

00:07:05.955 --> 00:07:10.193
AND ENCOURAGED ABOUT WHAT PAM

00:07:08.525 --> 00:07:12.696
BONDI, THE ATTORNEY GENERAL SAID

00:07:10.327 --> 00:07:13.663
THERE AS IT PERTAINS TO THE

00:07:12.829 --> 00:07:16.900
DEATH PENALTY.

00:07:13.797 --> 00:07:18.969
WHEN YOU PUT GAS MASKS ON, WHEN

00:07:17.033 --> 00:07:20.637
YOU PUT SMOKE BOMBS, YOU GO IN A

00:07:19.102 --> 00:07:21.738
SCHOOL AND PULL AN ALARM, YOU’RE

00:07:20.771 --> 00:07:23.407
ABLE TO SHOOT ALL THESE PEOPLE

00:07:21.872 --> 00:07:24.941
AND THEN ABLE TO LEAVE THAT

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:28.145
SCHOOL AND I WANT TO FIND OUT

00:07:25.075 --> 00:07:31.214
THAT YOU’RE MENTALLY ILL.

00:07:28.278 --> 00:07:33.083
I HAVE A SERIOUS PROBLEM WITH

00:07:31.348 --> 00:07:34.918
MENTAL ILLNESS WHEN YOU HAVE THE

